  "description": "A calm capybara with a hat for every mood (top hat, party hat, umbrella, graduation cap, cowboy hat, hard hat, propeller beanie) swapped in a puff of smoke. Munches grass and hosts a little bird while idle, codes on a tiny laptop, holds up a sign when it needs you, and dozes in a hot-spring tub with a yuzu on its head (and glares if you poke it awake). Squeaks when poked, dangles when picked up, flails as it falls and lands seeing stars.",
